      "title": "Publish extracted statements with source links",
      "description": "The standard step of adding source documents to a folio's working artifact: every statement extracted from a library source is published readably in the artifact's own pages AND in the shared extraction viewer, each with a link to its library entry and to the section it came from, and CI fails when the generated pages are stale. Generic across content types; each type's adapter says only how its pages look. Executable form: `processes/library/publish-extracted-statements.bpmn`.",
